OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FIn this special episode, the
OL,7,     Finterceptor's take on the young
OL,8,     Fand reckless who cause carnage on
OL,9,     Four roads and put themselves and
OL,10,     Fothers in danger.
OL,11,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FThe pursuit of a white van tearing
OL,13,     Fup the turf proves to be a family
OL,14,     Faffair, and a two-year-old German
OL,15,     Fshepherd cross named Titan earns
OL,16,     Fhis spurs.
OL,17,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FDog handler Darren calls on all
OL,19,     Fhis powers of persuasion to try
OL,20,     Fand end a rooftop stand-off, and
OL,21,     FSteve is forced to use his pepper
OL,22,     Fspray on a suspect.
