OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FHayley enters the surgery with a
OL,7,     Ffox bite, there's a milestone
OL,8,     Fmoment for a young woman as she
OL,9,     Fhas her first smear test, and
OL,10,     F94-year-old Doris returns for a
OL,11,     Fleg ulcer dressing.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe dedicated team at Barnsley A&E
OL,14,     Fneed to be ready for anything and
OL,15,     Feverything. 20 year old carpet
OL,16,     Ffitter accidentally stabbed
OL,17,     Fhimself in the leg at work and
OL,18,     Fneeds stitches.
