OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FThere's major trauma when a hay
OL,7,     Fbale lands on a farmer's head in a
OL,8,     Fremote location. Plus, a battle to
OL,9,     Fsave a man in cardiac arrest, and
OL,10,     Fa 76-year-old woman has fallen
OL,11,     Fdown the stairs.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FAn alcohol-dependent patient is
OL,14,     Ftransferred to resus after a fall,
OL,15,     Fjust in time to intercept a
OL,16,     Fseizure, and a man with a
OL,17,     Fdislocated shoulder has a shocking
OL,18,     Freaction to pain medication.
OL,19,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,20,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,21,     Fwhere four top dermatologists
OL,22,     Ftreat a range of conditions.
